Description: pan/libpan: turn an empty index range into a null draw
 When every index of an indexed indirect draw is a restart index (or the
 count is zero), the min/max search leaves min above max and the vertex
 range wrapped around. Use a range of zero so the jobs become null jobs.
Author: pocket-debs
Origin: https://github.com/masterxq/mesa-lisbon (branch lisbon/26.3)
Forwarded: no
License: MIT (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
